"Open a new tab and start the agent CLI in it wearing this role." = "开一个新标签页，在里面以这个角色启动 agent CLI。";
"Launch" = "启动";
"Starting %@" = "启动 %@";
"Model" = "模型";
"The CLI's default" = "CLI 默认";
"Extra Arguments" = "额外参数";
"Added to the command line as typed. Quote anything with a space in it." = "按原样追加到命令行。含空格的参数请加引号。";
"Read what's installed again" = "重新读取已安装的内容";
"%lld of %lld kept" = "保留 %lld / %lld";
"Keep All" = "全部保留";
"Turn All Off" = "全部关闭";
"Keep skills installed later" = "以后新装的 skill 默认保留";
"Keep MCP servers added later" = "以后新加的 MCP 服务器默认保留";
"What happens to anything that isn't listed here yet, such as something installed tomorrow or a project's own." = "决定这里还没列出的东西怎么处理，比如明天新装的、或某个项目自带的。";
"No skills are installed for this CLI." = "这个 CLI 没有安装任何 skill。";
"No MCP servers are configured for this CLI." = "这个 CLI 没有配置任何 MCP 服务器。";
"Nothing matches the filter." = "没有符合筛选条件的项。";
"Also in this role but not installed here: %@" = "角色里还提到了本机没装的：%@";
"Keep or turn off everything in this group" = "整组保留或关闭";
"Always kept: this is how the agent reaches Polter." = "始终保留：agent 靠它连到 Polter。";
"No description" = "没有说明";
"Show Less" = "收起";
"Show More" = "展开";

/* Role library: built-in roles and the Polter half of a role */
"Polter Supervisor" = "Polter 总管";
"Makes the terminal it starts in this window's supervisor: splits the work, hands it out and checks it." = "把启动它的终端设为本窗口的总管：拆分工作、派活、验收。";
"Comes with Polter" = "Polter 自带";
"This role comes with Polter and can't be changed or deleted. Duplicate it to make one of your own." = "这是 Polter 自带的角色，不能修改或删除。复制一份就能改成你自己的。";
"Duplicate" = "复制";
"Added to the agent's system prompt when it starts. Leave it empty to add nothing. Drag the bottom edge to make the box taller." = "启动时附加到 agent 的系统提示词后面。留空就什么都不加。拖动下边缘可以把输入框拉高。";
"Polter" = "Polter";
"Make this terminal a supervisor" = "将此终端设为总管";
"Let the supervisor answer this terminal's permission prompts" = "允许总管替你回答此终端的权限问题";
"Shield it: no tool can reach it, a supervisor's included" = "开启护盾：任何工具都碰不到它，总管也不行";
"These three give the terminal something, so only you can set them, here. A supervisor that edits roles can't change them." = "这三项会给终端授予权限，所以只有你能在这里设置。能编辑角色的总管也改不了它们。";
"Hand it to the supervisor to watch" = "交给总管监管";
"The supervisor that started it, or the only one there is. With several and you starting it, nobody." = "交给启动它的那个总管；如果是你启动的，就交给唯一的那个总管。有多个总管时不交给任何人。";
"Report it as still after" = "静止多久算卡住";
"%d min" = "%d 分钟";
"Open in" = "打开位置";
"Here when at a prompt, else a new tab" = "在提示符处就地打开，否则开新标签页";
"Always a new tab" = "始终在新标签页中打开";
"Applied once, when the role starts an agent CLI. Putting the role on a terminal that's already running changes its tools, not these." = "只在用这个角色启动 agent CLI 时生效一次。给已经在运行的终端换上这个角色，只会切换它的工具，不会改这些设置。";
"Drag to resize" = "拖动调整大小";
"Basics" = "基本信息";
"Skills %@" = "Skills %@";
"MCP %@" = "MCP %@";
"MCP" = "MCP";
"Pick an agent CLI under Basics first: skills and MCP servers belong to a CLI." = "先在「基本信息」里选一个 agent CLI：skill 和 MCP 服务器是属于某个 CLI 的。";
"Go to Basics" = "去基本信息";
"Filter skills" = "筛选 skill";
"Filter MCP servers" = "筛选 MCP 服务器";
